From 5059a14e72342e4b4da587fcb1e070aaf9c29171 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:57:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: caster mana thrift - opener, DoT, then wand or melee;
 spend when losing (F-219)

- Ability max_per_target / min_power_pct; both lift while losing (our health %
  under 50 and under the target's, or 2+ attackers)
- KillRequest wand_spell: a ranged fighter whose limited spells are spent
  wands from range, else closes in and melees with its weapon
- rotations: priest Smite -> Shadow Word: Pain -> melee; warlock Shadow Bolt
  -> Corruption/Immolate; druid Wrath -> Moonfire; shaman Lightning Bolt ->
  Earth Shock; mage two nukes + Fire Blast. DoTs carry a lower mana floor
- gear: wands (subclass 19, skill 228) are wearable; Shoot 5019 when worn
- Power Word: Shield every 16 s (Weakened Soul is 15 s)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
